          "description": "The most cloud a pass may carry and still enter the catalogue. It is the catalogue's own `eo:cloud_cover`, measured over the whole Sentinel-2 granule rather than over Cuenca, so it is a coarse cut. It starts at *All*, because how covered the passes come is part of what this board is showing.",
